<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Efficient-Llm</title><link>https://jaehun.me/categories/efficient-llm/</link><description>딥러닝 컴파일러 엔지니어 류재훈의 기술 블로그. LLM 추론 최적화, KV 캐시, 컴파일러, C++와 AI 논문·오픈소스 코드 분석을 정리합니다.</description><language>ko-kr</language><atom:link href="https://jaehun.me/categories/efficient-llm/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>[논문리뷰] Llama-Nemotron: Efficient Reasoning Models</title><link>https://jaehun.me/posts/%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8%EB%A6%AC%EB%B7%B0-llama-nemotron-efficient-reasoning-models/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jaehun.me/posts/%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8%EB%A6%AC%EB%B7%B0-llama-nemotron-efficient-reasoning-models/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 29 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0900</pubDate><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a&#10; href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.00949v4"target="_blank"&#10; class="inline-flex items-center gap-1"&#10; &gt;논문 링크&lt;svg class="h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0" id="external-link" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"&gt;&lt;path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="hydragen-공유-프리픽스가-있는-대규모-배치를-32--빠르게-디코딩하는-비밀-병기"&gt;Hydragen: 공유 프리픽스가 있는 대규모 배치를 32 × 빠르게 디코딩하는 비밀 병기&lt;a href="#hydragen-%ea%b3%b5%ec%9c%a0-%ed%94%84%eb%a6%ac%ed%94%bd%ec%8a%a4%ea%b0%80-%ec%9e%88%eb%8a%94-%eb%8c%80%ea%b7%9c%eb%aa%a8-%eb%b0%b0%ec%b9%98%eb%a5%bc-32--%eb%b9%a0%eb%a5%b4%ea%b2%8c-%eb%94%94%ec%bd%94%eb%94%a9%ed%95%98%eb%8a%94-%eb%b9%84%eb%b0%80-%eb%b3%91%ea%b8%b0" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h2 id="한-줄-요약-tldr"&gt;한 줄 요약 (TL;DR)&lt;a href="#%ed%95%9c-%ec%a4%84-%ec%9a%94%ec%95%bd-tldr" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Softmax 분모 재스케일링&lt;/em&gt;으로 프리픽스-서픽스를 분해해 &lt;strong&gt;Code-Llama-13 B&lt;/strong&gt; 기준 vLLM보다 &lt;em&gt;최대 32배&lt;/em&gt; 빠르게, 동일 출력을 보장하며 장문·대규모 배치 디코딩을 가속한다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>